{"content":[{"c":["HARMON*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Place mentioned by the prophet Amos to which the inhabitants of Bashan would be exiled (",{"href":"?bref=Amos.4.3","r":"Amos.4.3","rawR":"Amos.4.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Amos.4.3","value":"Amos.4.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"Am 4:3"},", ",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," mg). Harmon occurs only once in the Bible, and there is no known place with such a name. There are problems with the text and numerous emendations have been proposed. Some Hebrew manuscripts render it as a common noun, meaning “palace” (",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},"), rather than a proper name. The Septuagint renders it “the mountain of Rimmon,” perhaps referring to a hill east of Rimmon (see ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.20.45-47","r":"Judg.20.45-47","rawR":"Judg.20.45-47","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.20.45-47","value":"Judg.20.45-47"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 20:45-47"},"; cf. ",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.32","r":"Josh.15.32","rawR":"Josh.15.32","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.32","value":"Josh.15.32"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 15:32"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Josh.19.13","r":"Josh.19.13","rawR":"Josh.19.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.19.13","value":"Josh.19.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"19:13"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Harmon","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Am 4:3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Amos.4.3","rawQueryValue":"Amos.4.3","sourceRefExact":"Amos.4.3"},{"anchorText":"Jgs 20:45-47","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.20.45-47","rawQueryValue":"Judg.20.45-47","sourceRefExact":"Judg.20.45-47"},{"anchorText":"Jos 15:32","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.32","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.32","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.32"},{"anchorText":"19:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.19.13","rawQueryValue":"Josh.19.13","sourceRefExact":"Josh.19.13"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"c0526f3734551c00fe5594451125b3c68c2850a0becf048a2282690680b535d1","sourceItemName":"Harmon","sourceItemOrder":120,"sourceMember":"Articles/H.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Harmon","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Harmon*","title":"Harmon*","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}